    "guide.body.ai_pad" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put ChatGPT, Codex, or Cursor into the hub grid, then tap it on iPhone: instead of just launching the app, your phone becomes a dedicated controller for that agent, and the whole vibe-coding loop moves into your hand. Kick off a run, approve or redirect what the agent proposes, tune how hard it thinks, and jump between chat, edits, and the terminal — the model keeps working while you stay in the flow, phone in hand and away from the keyboard.\nChatGPT, Codex, and Cursor each get a layout tuned to how you actually drive them, and every control is remappable to fit your workflow.\nThe Mac needs Accessibility and Automation permission for TreeletHub — without it the controller shows a warning and the keys do nothing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 ChatGPT、Codex 或 Cursor 放进九宫格，在 iPhone 上点按它：手机不再只是启动应用，而是变成这个 agent 的专属控制器，整个 vibe coding 循环都握在手里。发起一次运行、批准或纠偏 agent 的提议、调节它思考的深浅、在对话 / 改动 / 终端之间切换——模型持续推进，你握着手机、离开键盘也能保持心流。\nChatGPT、Codex、Cursor 各有贴合你实际操作方式的布局，且每个控件都能自定义映射。\nMac 需要为 TreeletHub 开启「辅助功能」与「自动化」权限，否则控制器会提示未授权、按键无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.connect_ios" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0) Install the Mac app first (website DMG)—the iPhone app alone cannot launch Mac apps.\n1) On the Mac, open TreeletHub and read the six-digit pairing code.\n2) On iPhone, open Connect to Mac, type the code, then tap Connect.\n3) The first time, allow Local Network access when iOS prompts you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0）请先安装 Mac 版（官网 DMG）——仅装 iPhone 端无法启动 Mac 应用。\n1）在 Mac 上打开 TreeletHub，记下界面上的 6 位配对码。\n2）在 iPhone 的「连接 Mac」中输入配对码并点击连接。\n3）首次连接请在系统提示中允许「本地网络」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.gestures_ios" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the Apps launcher while paired: swipe down with two fingers to hide every open Mac app—including TreeletHub—and show the desktop."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已配对时在 Apps 启动墙上：双指下滑会隐藏 Mac 上全部已打开应用（含 TreeletHub 自身）以显示桌面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.island" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With Pro unlocked, turn on Dynamic Island in the Mac main window or Settings menu. A floating bar at the top of the screen can show media controls, pairing code / file staging, clipboard history, synced launcher pages, clock, and weather (WeatherKit needs Location)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解锁 Pro 后，在 Mac 主窗口或设置菜单开启「灵动岛」。屏幕顶部浮层可提供媒体控制、配对码 / 文件暂存、剪贴板历史、同步启动墙、时间与天气（WeatherKit 需定位）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.keyboard_hud" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With Pro unlocked, enable Keyboard Launcher on Mac, then allow Input Monitoring when prompted.\n1) Release Control to show the on-screen keymap; press a mapped key to launch, or Esc / click outside to dismiss.\n2) Control + key also toggles the mapped app globally.\n3) First enable auto-fills keys from app name initials; tap empty keys to add, drag to swap."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解锁 Pro 后，在 Mac 开启「键盘启动器」，并按提示允许「输入监控」。\n1）松开 Control 唤出屏幕键位浮层；按已映射键启动，Esc 或点浮层外关闭。\n2）也可随时用 Control + 按键全局唤起 / 隐藏对应应用。\n3）首次开启会按应用名首字母自动填键；点空键添加，拖拽可交换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.pro" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free: up to 10 apps/shortcuts on Mac. One-time Pro unlock ($9.99, not a subscription) removes the limit and unlocks Dynamic Island, Keyboard Launcher, and other Pro features. Purchase on Mac or iPhone via App Store; Mac unlock status syncs to paired phones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费：Mac 最多 10 个应用 / 快捷方式。一次性解锁 Pro（$9.99，非订阅）可无限添加，并开启灵动岛、键盘启动器等全部 Pro 功能。可在 Mac 或 iPhone 经 App Store 购买；Mac 解锁状态会同步到已配对手机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.push_to_talk" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1) Hold the PTT key on the control pad and speak—the words you say appear on the phone in real time.\n2) Recognition runs on the iPhone itself. No audio leaves the phone; only the finished text travels across your Wi‑Fi to the Mac.\n3) Let go and the text lands in the ChatGPT / Codex / Cursor composer on the Mac. Read it over, then tap Send.\nDouble-tap PTT within 350 ms for hands-free recording, and tap once more to stop. The first time you use it, allow Microphone and Speech Recognition on the iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1）在控制键盘上按住「PTT」键说话，手机上会实时显示识别出的文字。\n2）识别全程在 iPhone 本机完成，音频不会离开手机，只有最终文字经 Wi‑Fi 发送到 Mac。\n3）松手后文字会自动填入 Mac 上 ChatGPT / Codex / Cursor 的输入框，确认无误后点「Send」发送。\n350 毫秒内双击 PTT 可进入免提录音，再点一次结束。首次使用请允许 iPhone 的「麦克风」与「语音识别」权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.scenarios" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep TreeletHub running on your desk Mac. From the couch or another room, use your phone as a remote launcher for apps you already pinned on the Mac hub."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 上常驻 TreeletHub；你在客厅或别的房间，用手机快速唤起已放进 Mac 启动墙的应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.setup_ios" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use the Apps tab for the live honeycomb launcher. In Settings, rename how your phone appears on the Mac, change the backdrop, or swap your one saved photo background."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「Apps」使用与 Mac 同步的蜂巢启动墙；在「设置」里可修改在 Mac 上显示的设备名、更换界面背景，或替换仅保留一张的相册背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.setup_mac" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1) Tap the + button (or the dashed + on the honeycomb) to add an app, web shortcut, or system action.\n2) Pinch to zoom, drag to pan; Control-click a tile to remove it.\n3) Free plan includes up to 10 apps; unlock Pro once for unlimited slots.\n4) If you regenerate the pairing code on the Mac, each phone must reconnect with the new code.\n5) Open Settings (gear) for Dynamic Island, Keyboard Launcher, language, and Pro unlock."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1）点按「+」按钮（或蜂巢墙上的虚线 +）添加应用、网页快捷方式或系统操作。\n2）捏合缩放、拖动浏览；Control-点击格子可清除。\n3）免费最多 10 个应用；一次性解锁 Pro 后不限数量。\n4）在 Mac 上重新生成配对码后，已配对手机需用新码重连。\n5）右上角齿轮可开关灵动岛、键盘启动器，以及语言与 Pro 解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guide.body.what" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TreeletHub runs on your Mac as a honeycomb launcher for favorite apps and shortcuts. Pair your iPhone or Android on the same Wi‑Fi to launch those Mac apps remotely. Layout stays in sync across devices."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TreeletHub 在 Mac 上以蜂巢启动墙收纳常用应用与快捷方式；同一 Wi‑Fi 下的 iPhone / Android 配对后可远程启动这些 Mac 应用，布局会在设备间同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
